00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:15.210
What's this? You're acting funny.

00:00:15.290 --> 00:00:17.170
Are you hiding something?

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:20.210
<i>How is she so perceptive?</i>

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:24.960
Does it have anything to do with your meeting
with the president of HPW yesterday?

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:26.170
Nope.

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:29.540
Not that it's any of your business.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:35.880
Hm... You're acting suspicious.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:43.630
I-I'll be joining this class
with you all starting today.

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.040
My name is Tsukinomori Mashiro.

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:48.960
I, um... er...

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:54.330
I'm actually g-going out
with Ohboshi Akiteru-kun!

00:00:55.540 --> 00:00:56.500
For real?!

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:59.670
Man, a babe like her is wasted on him!

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:01.500
Wait, who's Ohboshi-kun, anyway?

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:03.880
Hey, question!

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:07.130
- Where did you meet Ohboshi-kun?
- Huh?

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:10.420
- Um... the bathroom?
- Wha?

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:11.960
<i>You idiot! Do you hear yourself?!</i>

00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:14.210
<i>Also, that's not where we first met!</i>

00:01:14.290 --> 00:01:16.580
Um... I-I forget!

00:01:16.670 --> 00:01:19.290
P-Please don't ask any further about that!

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:25.210
<i>I doubt any guys will mess with her</i>
<i>knowing she has a boyfriend.</i>

00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:26.960
Let's try to make this work, okay?

00:01:27.080 --> 00:01:29.420
Don't talk to me, you pervy toilet fiend.

00:01:29.670 --> 00:01:32.250
I haven't forgiven you, you know.

00:01:32.710 --> 00:01:36.330
Why do you become this high-and-mighty
queen the moment I talk to you?

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:38.420
Because I hate you. Simple.

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:40.750
Are you even gonna <i>try</i>
to act like my girlfriend?

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:45.540
So long as we keep our stories straight,
these idiots won't notice how I treat you.

00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:47.670
I won't even pretend to be friendly.

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:49.080
Don't look at me.

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:52.460
Come on, you know that's never gonna fly.

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:58.580
That sure was a surprise.
Why'd you keep it secret all this time?

00:01:58.670 --> 00:02:00.500
Sorry, Ozu.

00:02:00.580 --> 00:02:02.580
Long story, but the point is,
it's not like that.

00:02:02.670 --> 00:02:03.710
Okay.

00:02:04.330 --> 00:02:06.460
Does it have anything to do
with you-know-what?

00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:09.920
Kinda. I'll explain everything later.

00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:46.290 line:20%
MY FRIEND'S LITTLE SISTER HAS IT IN FOR ME!

00:03:46.630 --> 00:03:50.920 line:20%
#02 "THE COUSIN I HAVEN'T
SEEN IN YEARS IS COLD TO ME"

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:57.080
So in the end, I agreed to play
the role of her fake boyfriend.

00:03:57.880 --> 00:04:00.170
<i>I explained everything to Ozu.</i>

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:04.750
<i>After all, he's "Oz," the brilliant</i>
<i>programmer of 05th Floor Alliance.</i>

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:08.670
Wow, you're like the protagonist in a rom-com.

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:10.330
You're one to talk.

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:13.580
With that refreshing smile
and your sweet personality,

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:17.670
all you need is a little sister with a
brother complex to be the perfect protag.

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:19.580
<i>That's definitely not her, though.</i>

00:04:19.670 --> 00:04:21.920
Well, Iroha's in love with you, after all.

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:23.080
Yeah, no chance of that.

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:27.250
I think you're the perfect fit
for the oblivious protag role, myself.

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:31.170
Well, I'm gonna go buy lunch.

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:34.290
Ohboshi!

00:04:34.380 --> 00:04:36.420
What the heck, man? You have a <i>girlfriend?!</i>

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:37.540
Well, yeah.

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:40.830
But you're always all friendly
with that younger girl!

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:48.790
<i>Yikes.</i>

00:04:48.880 --> 00:04:52.420
That's Ozu's little sister.
We're not like that.

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:54.540
You sure seemed close, though.

00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:58.500
Suzuki, if I recall, you had your sights
set on Kageishi-sensei, right?

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:02.130
I heard she prefers macho guys.

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:03.420
I see...

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:05.080
I see!

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:07.580
Okay, then!

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:12.920
Problem?

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:15.750
I'm hungry. Go buy me some rice balls.

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:17.960
Seafood is the only acceptable filling.

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:20.790
Huh? Why do I have to be your errand boy?

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:22.540
You're my boyfriend. You can handle it.

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:24.830
Or shall we just call off
the whole dating thing?

00:05:25.710 --> 00:05:28.750
Okay, fine. I'll go buy you some rice balls.

00:05:30.920 --> 00:05:32.920 line:20%
TUNA MAYO

00:05:33.290 --> 00:05:36.790
If you want to thank me...
Nah, I guess you wouldn't.

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:43.920
<i>She's just getting grumpier and grumpier.</i>

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:48.290
<i>Did hearing what we were</i>
<i>talking about make her jealous?</i>

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:53.540
<i>Nah, no way. Mashiro hates my guts.</i>

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:58.000
<i>She's a pain on a whole different</i>
<i>vector than Mashiro.</i>

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:02.000
<i>Damn, this is one tough mission.</i>

00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:13.380
I'm glad the monkey house
seems to have closed.

00:06:14.170 --> 00:06:17.420
I assume you've all done your homework, yes?

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:21.130
I'm sorry. I forgot to do it...

