society demands of functional adults.

00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:37.750
Those who fail to meet these
criteria are less than scum!

00:06:38.420 --> 00:06:39.460
But...

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:41.460
There won't <i>be</i> a next time.

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:42.790
Y-Yes, ma'am...

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:46.250
We don't have time to waste. Moving on...

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:50.960
<i>She's a bit much for a new kid</i>
<i>just transferring in, huh?</i>

