I swear...

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:04.920
Who knew you were actually so useless?

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:12.500 line:20%
REFRESHING WATER

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:14.710
<i>Damn, still no luck.</i>

00:10:14.790 --> 00:10:16.960
<i>This next one will be the 79th...</i>

00:10:20.210 --> 00:10:21.500 line:20%
CHRONICLES OF GENJI

00:10:21.580 --> 00:10:23.210 line:20%
NOW YOU MATCH BIG SIS.
HOW CUTE!

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:31.080
<i>This is the kind of oneshota fetish depiction</i>
<i>that only the real deal could pull off!</i>

00:10:31.630 --> 00:10:33.960
Um, excuse me.

00:10:34.460 --> 00:10:36.670
Are you an editor from a publishing company?

00:10:37.330 --> 00:10:40.630
I appreciate the offer,
but I'm not interested in...

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:50.460
If only we hadn't met there
in the worst possible way.

