00:15:55.290 --> 00:15:58.500
<i>I'd be risking giving passing students</i>
<i>an eyeful of her bare breasts!</i>

00:15:58.580 --> 00:16:01.080
<i>She's a pain in the ass,</i>
<i>but she's my best friend's sister!</i>

00:16:01.170 --> 00:16:03.460
<i>I can't let anything happen</i>
<i>that would make him sad!</i>

00:16:03.540 --> 00:16:07.170
<i>Besides, I'm supposed to be</i>
<i>dating Mashiro right now.</i>

00:16:08.130 --> 00:16:12.500
<i>Getting this cozy with a junior having</i>
<i>a wardrobe malfunction is a very bad look!</i>

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:16.920
<i>And if my uncle finds out, it's all over!</i>

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:20.250
I'm willing to let go if you surrender.

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:22.080
I hope you don't regret this.

00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:23.630
Because I won't hold back!

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:25.540
Whoa, wait—

00:16:28.540 --> 00:16:30.880
S-Senpai! This is way too embarrassing!

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:33.040
Put me down! Come on, put me down!

00:16:33.130 --> 00:16:35.500
It beats having your tits
out on display, surely?

00:16:35.880 --> 00:16:38.920
Or will you surrender
and admit that was a lie?

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:41.670
D-Darn you...

00:16:41.750 --> 00:16:44.750
- A-Are you sure you want to do this?!
- Not a problem.

00:16:48.210 --> 00:16:49.380
Whoa, wait!

00:16:49.960 --> 00:16:52.710
Not even a moment's hesitation?! For real?!

00:16:52.790 --> 00:16:55.460
What is this insanely confident forward march?!

00:16:55.540 --> 00:16:57.830
I'm just taking a route
where we're less likely to be seen.

00:16:57.920 --> 00:17:00.330
How do you even know where that would be?!

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:02.880
The art of knowing your routes,
cultivated through RPGs,

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:06.080
is essential for getting
through life efficiently.

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:07.920
...der!

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:10.920
I surrender, okay?! Please put me down!

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:14.880
Don't you have something to say?

00:17:15.420 --> 00:17:16.630
I'm sorry.

00:17:16.710 --> 00:17:19.040
And what are you sorry for?

00:17:19.880 --> 00:17:24.580
I... I'm very sorry for telling
a lie and teasing you!

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:27.460
Meanie.

00:17:28.250 --> 00:17:32.040
It's what you get for constantly messing with
me without regard for the trouble it causes.

00:17:32.130 --> 00:17:36.630
Aw, and after I ditched my bra
to go on the offensive...

00:17:37.630 --> 00:17:39.580
<i>The bra-less part was true?!</i>

00:17:41.420 --> 00:17:43.170
There is one thing you can help me with.

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:44.580
Oh? What is it?

00:17:44.920 --> 00:17:48.080
How do I make friends with a woman
who's a pain in the ass?

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:52.460
Wait, what? Is there a girl you like now?

00:17:52.540 --> 00:17:54.960
No, it's not like that.

00:17:56.460 --> 00:17:59.420
Ah, right, right. I see now.

00:17:59.500 --> 00:18:02.290
You really are a meddler, aren't you?

00:18:02.380 --> 00:18:04.420
It's all for my own benefit, though.

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:08.250
I'd ask if there was really any need
to actually be friends with her,

00:18:08.330 --> 00:18:13.670
but I'm guessing what's really going on here
is that you don't want her to be lonely.

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:15.750
You really are a meddler.

00:18:15.830 --> 00:18:17.960
I guess. But still,

00:18:18.040 --> 00:18:20.210
I have no idea what I should do.

00:18:21.040 --> 00:18:23.080
Just leave it all to me!

00:18:23.170 --> 00:18:25.580
Since you have no clue
how a maiden's heart works,

00:18:25.670 --> 00:18:29.460
I'll teach you all you need to know
to conquer Mashiro-san!

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:32.920
Allow me to carry your bag.

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:36.630
- What the heck?
- What's with him?

00:18:36.710 --> 00:18:37.750
Wha?

00:18:40.960 --> 00:18:43.080
Your meal is ready.

00:18:43.710 --> 00:18:44.750
Huh?

00:18:45.130 --> 00:18:47.960
Come, my lady! Your steed awaits!

00:18:51.130 --> 00:18:52.250
What is this?

00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:54.380
Come with me.

00:18:57.540 --> 00:19:00.210
You are insufferable!
What kind of prank is this?

00:19:00.540 --> 00:19:02.040
I guess so, huh?

00:19:02.790 --> 00:19:06.790
<i>A bag carrier, errand boy,</i>
<i>and lapdog turned love slave?</i>

00:19:06.880 --> 00:19:10.750
Senpai! This is sure to make
Mashiro-san fall for you!

00:19:10.830 --> 00:19:15.170
<i>This is the Mashiro-conquering plan</i>
<i>100% produced by Kohinata Iroha!</i>

00:19:15.830 --> 00:19:19.630
To be honest, I had an inkling
this wasn't gonna work myself.

00:19:19.710 --> 00:19:20.830
What? Just die.

00:19:21.170 --> 00:19:25.420
You knew it would annoy me and did it
anyway? Do you hate me that much?

00:19:25.500 --> 00:19:28.630
- No, I don't. I just...
- What?

00:19:28.710 --> 00:19:32.040
Woohoo! Found a couple
getting lovey-dovey after school!

00:19:32.460 --> 00:19:35.210
Well, ya gonna kiss? Ya gonna kiss?

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:37.420
Who is she?

00:19:37.500 --> 00:19:40.580
Hi! I'm the one who set all this up!

00:19:40.670 --> 00:19:42.500
Hey! Where do you get off?

00:19:42.580 --> 00:19:44.960
- What a pain... Wait, what?
- Well, it worked great, didn't it?

00:19:45.040 --> 00:19:45.960
Like hell it did!

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:47.290
She's...

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:52.790
Ah, I get it. I understand everything now.

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:54.380
Huh?

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:55.670
I'm leaving.

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:57.380
Hey, what got into you?

00:19:57.460 --> 00:20:00.500
That's the cute junior
you're tight with, isn't it?

00:20:00.580 --> 00:20:01.790
Huh?

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:05.210
You two had a jolly old time
laughing at me together.

00:20:05.290 --> 00:20:06.460
Die, you dirty couple.

00:20:08.920 --> 00:20:12.290
Oh, boy. Looks like we made her angry.

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:14.630
Guess we should just go home for today.

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:19.920
What are you, a stalker now?

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:21.790
No! I live here!

00:20:21.880 --> 00:20:24.080
It's also where I live, by the way!

00:20:24.170 --> 00:20:25.130
What?

00:20:25.210 --> 00:20:27.540
Just what are you to Aki?

00:20:27.630 --> 00:20:29.250
I'm his sis!

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:31.670
Huh? Aki, you don't have a sister, do you?

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:33.960
I'm his friend's sister,
so I'm his sister in spirit!

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:35.420
SIS for short!

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:36.500
Are you dumb?

00:20:36.580 --> 00:20:38.380
Wow, harsh!

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:42.040
Mashiro-paisen, your attack power's
as impressive as Senpai's!

00:20:42.330 --> 00:20:45.210
Are you two... living together?

00:20:45.290 --> 00:20:47.210
No, we're not.

00:20:47.290 --> 00:20:49.500
I live in apartment 502...

00:20:49.580 --> 00:20:52.130
And I live in 503!

00:20:52.210 --> 00:20:55.630
And our classmate, Kohinata Ozuma,
is the older brother.

00:20:55.710 --> 00:20:58.080
"The" older brother? I'm here, you know!

00:20:58.170 --> 00:21:01.420
And apartment 504 is where
Kageishi-sensei lives.

00:21:02.500 --> 00:21:04.250
Er... Huh?

00:21:04.330 --> 00:21:05.420
Mashiro?

00:21:06.080 --> 00:21:09.040
You suck! Kohinata-san sucks!

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:11.880
Everything about being near you all sucks!

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:13.630
Hey, Mashiro...

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:18.790
She ran away from you again.

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:20.420
What are you gonna do?

00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:22.210
It's fine.

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:26.500
"05th Floor Alliance"... Don't tell me...

00:21:26.920 --> 00:21:29.880
<i>The reason she went so far as moving</i>
<i>to change her environment...</i>

00:21:30.250 --> 00:21:33.710
<i>is that she's trying to reset</i>
<i>her life in her own way.</i>

00:21:34.080 --> 00:21:37.080
<i>In which case, there's only</i>
<i>one thing for me to do.</i>

00:21:38.040 --> 00:21:41.080
<i>To achieve the optimal outcome</i>
<i>in the most efficient way,</i>

00:21:41.630 --> 00:21:44.830
<i>I have to do everything</i>
<i>I possibly can for Mashiro.</i>

00:21:45.500 --> 00:21:50.000
I'm gonna show you
what it really means to meddle!

00:23:21.130 --> 00:23:26.080
DON'T MISS THE NEXT EPISODE!